<title>FRANCE: CGE sees various cable candidates - paper.</title>
<headline>CGE sees various cable candidates - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux Chairman Jean-Marie Messier said in an interview with Le Monde that he saw various possible buyers for the company's cable activities.</p>
<p>He cited Time Warner, Koninklijke PTT Nederland and TCI as possibilities.</p>
<p>&quot;We have given ourselves several months to chose with Havas a partner for the cable. There are various possibilities -- Time Warner, KPN, TCI. I want the cable network to be run in a commercial partnership with Cegetel at one side and Canal Plus at the other,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
